      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STAR OF WILLOUGHBY (3) made it two wins in succession last time out, making up plenty of ground to score by 2 metres over 1609m at Gawler. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Taking on a better field but he is up to the task. AMYS BABY ANGEL (1) has been racing well of late. Finished second at her latest appearance over 2230m at this track, beaten only 2 metres. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw and on her best form she is capable of testing her rivals. FENG SHUI STAR (2) was responsible for a better effort last time out when runner-up over 1800m here. Should run a big race. WEREGOINGTOGETCHA (5) is the best of the rest after finishing third over 1800m at this circuit last time out. May trouble the judge with any luck in running.",
